### melodicake@disroot.org
IMAPStore melodicake@disroot.org-remote
Host disroot.org
Port 993
User melodicake@disroot.org
PassCmd "pass personal/melodicake_disroot"
SSLType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

# local
MaildirStore melodicake@disroot.org-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/melodicake@disroot.org/
Inbox ~/Mail/melodicake@disroot.org/INBOX

# sync
Channel melodicake@disroot.org
Expunge Both
Far :melodicake@disroot.org-remote:
Near :melodicake@disroot.org-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *

